e harness connector due to a mixture of snow/water and salt seeping through the carpet on the driver side floor near the harness connector.","consequence":"An electrical short can cause a vehicle fire.","remedy":"Nissan will notify owners, and dealers will inspect the kick panel wiring harness connector and will if necessary install a new harness connector and waterproof seal, free of charge.  The recall began on February 26, 2015.  Owners may contact Nissan customer service at 1-800-647-7261.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":468815,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=15V032000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":7,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2009","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE"},{"year":"2008","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE"},{"year":"2010","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE"},{"year":"2011","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE"},{"year":"2012","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE"},{"year":"2013","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE"},{"year":"2014","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"12V068000","received":"2012-02-22","manufacturer":"NISSAN NORTH AMERICA, INC.","component":"TIRES:PRESSURE MONITORING AND REGULATING SYSTEMS","summary":"NISSAN IS RECALLING CERTAIN MODEL YEAR 2012 MURANO AND ROGUE VEHICLES, MANUFACTURED FROM NOVEMBER 23, 2011 THROUGH JANUARY 11, 2012.  DURING ASSEMBLY, THE TIRE PRESSURE MONITORING SYSTEM (TPMS) WAS NOT ACTIVATED. THUS, THESE VEHICLES FAIL TO COMPLY WITH THE REQUIREMENTS OF FEDERAL MOTOR VEHICLE SAFETY STANDARD NO. 138,TIRE PRESSURE MONITORING SYSTEM.","consequence":"A NON-ACTIVE TPMS CANNOT WARN A DRIVER THAT A TIRE IS UNDERINFLATED. UNDERINFLATED TIRES CAN RESULT IN TIRE OVERLOADING AND OVERHEATING, WHICH COULD LEAD TO A BLOWOUT AND POSSIBLE CRASH.","remedy":"ALL OF THE AFFECTED VEHICLES ARE STILL IN DEALER INVENTORY.  DEALERS HAVE BEEN INSTRUCTED TO ACTIVATE ALL OF THE TIRE PRESSURE MONITORING SYSTEMS.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":2983,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=12V068000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":2,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2012","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE"},{"year":"2012","make":"NISSAN","model":"MURANO"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false}]}
